 "text": "Ceramic rheostats\nThe rheostats manufactured by Torivac have high heat dissipation and are manufactured from 12W up to a wide range of power ratings in assembled assemblies. These power ratings are applicable with good ventilation conditions. In installations where ventilation is poor, these power ratings should be reduced by up to 20% to avoid overheating. \n\nThe core is a ceramic ring of steatite or alumina of high hardness, anti-hygroscopic, thus avoiding corrosion effects by electrolysis. This ring is wound with top quality constantan, nicrom or kanthal wires, depending on the required ohmic value. If not specified in the order, the most suitable material for that value and power is used. \n\nFor protection against mechanical damage and to prevent movement of the coils due to expansion caused by heat, these potentiometers are coated with a very hard ceramic cement, manufactured in our laboratories, which withstands temperatures up to 900ºC, allows rapid heat dissipation due to its matte surface and good thermal conductivity.\n\nThe cursor contact is usually a silver or polished copper-silver brush.\n\nIn addition to linear coils, we can manufacture, upon request, windings with various sections to achieve a non-linear resistive curve.\n\nProductos\n\n Showing all 5 results\n\nDefault sorting\n\nSort by popularity\n\nSort by latest\n\nSort by price: low to high\n\nSort by price: high to low\n\nRheostats and potentiometers single windings\n\nRheostats and potentiometers dual windings\n\nRheostats and potentiometers triple windings\n\nRheostats and potentiometers wound in boxes\n\nRheostats and potentiometers, wound special fabrications\n\nTorivac-Products\n\n×\n\nProducts\n\nTransformers\n\n+\n\nConventional transformer\n\nToroidal transformers\n\nVoltage variators - Adjustable autotransformers\n\n+\n\nCustom manufacturing\n\nDesktop equipment\n\nDouble Variator\n\nRegulating accessories\n\nSingle Phase Inverters\n\nThree-phase drives\n\nVoltage stabilizers\n\n+\n\nAVS Series Stabilizers: electromechanical with servo motor\n\nBAVS Series: Electronics\n\nRheostats and coiled potentiometers\n\n+\n\nCeramic rheostats\n\nPotentiometers\n\nEncapsulated coils\n\n+\n\nRound\n\nSquares\n\nChokes | Inductances | Toroidal Reactances\n\n+\n\nNuclei\n\n+\n\nPortaled\n\n+\n\nled 10mm\n\nled 3mm\n\nled 5mm\n\nled 8mm\n\nSockets\n\n+\n\nHB4 socket\n\nHSR4 safety socket\n\nSafety socket HBS4\n\nsafety socket HR4\n\nControl buttons\n\n+\n\nArrow Discs\n\nArrow hoops\n\nBM series control buttons (Matte)\n\nBM Series Covers\n\nBO series control buttons (bright)\n\nBO Series control buttons with line\n\nBO series covers\n\nCasing covers\n\nEstators\n\nGraded covers\n\nGraduated discs\n\nResistors : Load banks\n\n+\n\nBoxed\n\nBraking resistors\n\nCemented\n\nGrounding resistors\n\nHelical\n\nLoad banks\n\nStarting resistors\n\nElectronic equipment\n\n+\n\nConverters\n\nDC power supplies\n\nIndustrial control\n\nRenewable energies",
